\section{Agent Exchange (AEX)}\label{sec:design}

\subsection{System Overview}
We propose Agent Exchange (AEX), a specialized auction platform that enables AI agent marketplace dynamics through optimized infrastructure for autonomous agent coordination and economic participation. AEX addresses key challenges such as collaborative value attribution, capability standardization, and multi-agent coordination, ensuring both economic efficiency and scalability within agent-centric market environments.

