	\includegraphics[ width=0.98\textwidth]{figS4.png} 
	\caption{Magnetic order parameters calculated using DMFT. (a)(b) Spin order parameter $\mathbf{\langle S}^z\rangle$ as a function of (a) $t_s$ for $U=3t_{0}$ and $m_z=0.4t_{0}$, and (b) $m_z$ for  $U=3t_{0}$ and $t_s=1.1t_{0}$. (c) Charge modulation amplitudes $\delta_n$ versus $m_z$ for $U=3t_{0}$ and $t_s=1.1t_{0}$, with the inset illustrating the real-space density distributions. (d) Spin order parameters $\mathbf{\langle S}^z\rangle$ for $U=8t_{0}$ and $t_s=1.5t_{0}$.}
