(b) Snapshot for the non-equilibrium system governed by Eqs.~(\ref{eq: collision rule RanNi}, \ref{eq: damping}) with attraction. All parameters are identical to those in the equilibrium case without thermostat, and $\delta E$ is chosen to match the kinetic energy of the equilibrium system. 
