    \href{https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/UV8BOW}{10.7910/DVN/UV8BOW}
    \item  Dataverse entry, mix of R, Stata, and Matlab files \\ 
    \href{https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/HLO4XC}{10.7910/DVN/HLO4XC} 
