        \beta_t^B = &  \bar A^B_t + \int_0^t \bar C_{s,t}^B \cdot \mathbb{E}\left[ \mu |\mathcal{F}_s \right] d s + \bar D_t^B \cdot \mathbb{E}\left[ \mu | \mathcal{F}_t\right].
