    \orn{\bra{X}\bigl[S_n^\dagger S_\nbar (0)\bigr]_{kl}\ket{0}}\,.
\end{align}
In the next section, the above contributions will be combined with eqs.~\eqref{eq:HadronicTensorCn} and \eqref{eq:HadronicTensorCnbar} to define a kinematic power correction that is free of rapidity divergences.


